' A v1.2 game, played by a preset with no opponent (`ai none`, an internal
' stage: the seats are empty, not played). Run with `preset classic ai none
' start 3` or `preset extended ai none start 3` — `start 3` is the test tool
' that puts the player at Bearwoods. In among the dogs, fight mode, and blows
' at one dog until it falls: table blows (`TableCombat`), and each click an
' encounter (`LocalCombatEncounter`) — the longer-reaching dog strikes first
' as the player closes, and that is its one answer. Its bites between times
' are `AttackWithoutRetaliation`. The cut comes between two attacks,
' so the resume fights.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 61,355          ' into Bearwoods
wait 60
mapclick 300,120         ' walk in among the dogs
wait 100
fight
clickon 142              ' the dog: an encounter
wait 90                  ' long enough for its flight to end: a fight in progress is not saved, upstream neither
mapmove -116,0           ' the pointer off the place: a load does not know where it was, and v1.2 stops whoever is under it (Character.cs:1007-1009)
save                     ' the cut, before the next attack
